{
  "_comment": "A Web PubSub system connect event in CloudEvents binary mode, shaped after https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-web-pubsub/reference-cloud-events#system-connect-event. Fictional ids and host; the test sets ce-userId, ce-signature and the query per case.",
